          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SO 90 SQ              THE LEE              THE LEE                                            (north side) 5/103                                      Guild Cottage - GV                                         II                                            House.  C17 refronted early C19.  Brick casing to timber framing; framing exposed to west gable and at rear. Old tile roof.  C19 front relates to subdivision into pair of handed cottages.  Four bays, two storeys. Left hand and right hand bays, 3-light casements.  Inner bay with board doors with lean-to tiled hoods over.  Centre half glazed door.  First floor with 2-light casements to outer bays with gables over.  Stacks at ends.  Two storey rear addition.  Old tiled roof.  Interior: has four centred fireplace to back wall of left hand bay, now blocked, of early C17 type.  Chamfered and stopped spine beams. Listing NGR: SP9004904284"
    }
  ],
